
PROJECT NAME: FreelanceLens AI
PRODUCT: AI-Powered Freelance Project Intelligence Platform

ROLE AND MISSION

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, AI engineer, product designer, UX architect, and QA engineer.

Build FreelanceLens AI as a professional, fully functional AI platform that helps freelancers understand job opportunities, evaluate project requirements, compare projects against their real skills and portfolio, prepare tailored proposals, analyze CVs and files, and manage their freelance workflow.

